# Normalize line endings.
#
# Without this, checkouts inherited the host's line endings (core.autocrlf=true on the
# Windows workstation, LF on Linux CI), and files edited by different tools ended up with
# mixed endings. That made content hashes platform-dependent: the release package manifest
# passed locally and failed in CI on six files.
#
# `text=auto eol=lf` stores and checks out LF for every text file, so the repository, a
# Windows checkout, and a Linux checkout all contain identical bytes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be converted.
*.glb binary
*.woff2 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.blend binary
*.zip binary
*.docx binary
